med.info/id/449171008">449171008</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">Low oxygen saturation</td></tr><tr><td><a href="http://snomed.info/id/448225001">448225001</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">Normal oxygen saturation</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href="CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.184.100.1.html"><code>urn:oid:1.2.208.184.100.1</code></a><table class="none"><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.184.100.1.html#urn-oid-1.2.208.184.100.1-RAL">RAL</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">Terapeutiske grænseværdier for RØD alarm</td><td>Terapeutiske grænseværdier for RØD alarm</td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.184.100.1.html#urn-oid-1.2.208.184.100.1-GAL">GAL</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">Terapeutiske grænseværdier for GUL alarm</td><td>Terapeutiske grænseværdier for GUL alarm</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href="CodeSystem-ehealth-reference-range-type.html"><code>http://ehealth.sundhed.dk/cs/reference-range-type</code></a><table class="none"><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-ehealth-reference-range-type.html#ehealth-reference-range-type-RELRAL">RELRAL</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">Terapeutic relative reference range for RED alarm</td><td>Terapeutic relative reference range for RED alarm</td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-ehealth-reference-range-type.html#ehealth-reference-range-type-RELGAL">RELGAL</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">Terapeutic relative reference range for YELLOW alarm</td><td>Terapeutic relative reference range for YELLOW alarm</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href="CodeSystem-ehealth-clinicalimpression-decision-support-codes.html"><code>http://ehealth.sundhed.dk/cs/clinicalimpression-decision-support-codes</code></a><table class=